// The invaders example: a fleet marches down and you shoot it, a game
// whose engine runs beside the screen, written in Clarity. Its only target
// is the web: the program is a web server, and the game plays in the
// browser that visits it. The modules are in the invaders folder next to
// this file.
project Invaders
    title "Invaders"
    stack go web web
    output "out"
    language "en"
    datasource main sqlite "data/invaders.db"
